      "fields": {
        "ID": "RHCSA-PACKAGES-O01-QA-002",
        "Question": "<p>repo 的 <code>baseurl</code>、<code>enabled</code>、<code>gpgcheck</code>、<code>gpgkey</code> 分别表达什么？</p>",
        "Answer": "<p>仓库内容根、默认启用状态、包签名校验策略、可信公钥入口。</p>",
